{"sections":[{"slug":"单点(同伦类型论)","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"单点(同伦类型论)"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">单点</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">同伦类型论</span>)"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"subject":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/同伦类型论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦类型论</span>"}}]},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"单点 (同伦类型论)"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">单点是同伦类型论中零个类型的乘积</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">只有一种方式构造类型</span> $\\mathbf 1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\star\\colon \\mathbf 1$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $x,y\\colon \\mathbf 1$, <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $(x=y)\\simeq\\mathbf 1$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">首先</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">有明显的映射</span> $(x=y)\\to 1$ <span lang=\"zh\">将一切映射到</span> $\\star$. <span lang=\"zh\">另一方面</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $x,y\\colon 1$, <span lang=\"zh\">由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/归纳","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶归纳类型</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">不妨设</span> $x\\equiv \\star$, $y\\equiv \\star$. <span lang=\"zh\">那么我们有</span> $\\mathsf {refl}_{\\star}\\colon x=y$. <span lang=\"zh\">这给出一个映射</span> $1 \\to (x=y)$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">我们证明上述两个映射互逆</span>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathbf 1\\to (x=y)\\to \\mathbf 1$, <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $u\\colon \\mathbf 1$, <span lang=\"zh\">不妨设</span> $u\\equiv\\star$. <span lang=\"zh\">这说明这个复合是恒等</span>.</li>\n<li>$(x=y)\\to\\mathbf 1\\to(x=y)$. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $p\\colon (x=y)$, <span lang=\"zh\">由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/路径归纳","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">路径归纳</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">不妨设</span> $x\\equiv y$ <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $p\\equiv\\mathsf {refl}_x$. <span lang=\"zh\">那么又不妨设</span> $x\\equiv\\star$. <span lang=\"zh\">此时复合映射将</span> $p$ <span lang=\"zh\">映射到</span> $\\mathsf {refl}_x$, <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span> $p$ <span lang=\"zh\">自身</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">推论</span>. $\\mathbf 1$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/集合(同伦类型论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">集合</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}